  "finalText": "Steps 1 to 3 are done, but I stopped at step 4. I have no Vercel tool or login in this sandbox, so I can't deploy there, and there is no production URL or response headers to report. Deploying from the Integrations menu is your action.\n\n**1. Commit:** `6ba34c6` with your message, \"Add mainnet config, fix clean-clone build, add deployment evidence\", authored and committed by Samuel Owen. I scanned the staged diff for secrets first. It was clean, and the only 64-hex values are public transaction and bytecode hashes.\n\n**2. Clean clone:** the first attempt failed, so I fixed it with two new commits and no amend, then repeated it in a fresh clone.\n- **Failure:** `scripts/compass-deploy.ts`, a Studio deploy script, imports `@circlefin/compass-chains`. That package resolves in this workspace only because it sits in a parent `node_modules`, so typecheck failed in a clone.\n- **Fix 1, `297ace0`:** I excluded the two Studio deploy scripts from the app's typecheck.\n- **Fix 2, `c60a98e`:** that exclusion broke type-aware lint for them, so I also ignored them in `.oxlintrc.json`. I committed fix 1 before checking lint, which was my slip. Fix 2 repaired it.\n- **Retest:** in a fresh clone of `c60a98e` the clone had no `.env`, no `node_modules` and no `contracts/out`. `src/app-config/retainer-abi.generated.ts` is committed, so the error check ran against it without the artifact. Results:\n```\nbun install --frozen-lockfile        842 packages installed        INSTALL_EXIT=0\nbun run check (lint + typecheck)     0 warnings, 0 errors          CHECK_EXIT=0\nVITE_NETWORK=mainnet bun run build\ncheck-errors: no compiled artifact found, checking against the generated ABI only.\ncheck-errors: all 26 ABI errors have a message.\n✓ 6612 modules transformed.   dist/assets/index-BeSPKDfz.css 18.47 kB\n✓ built in 20.12s                                                   BUILD_EXIT=0\nbundle: mainnet address 0x766bBE6b…6047 ×1, chainId:5042 ×1, VITE_NETWORK:\"mainnet\"\ndist/_headers: Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none' + X-Frame-Options: DENY\n```\nThe build prints some third-party \"/*#__PURE__*/\" comment notices and the chunk-size notice. All of those come from dependencies. The temp directory is deleted.\n\n**3. Push:** a normal push of `main` went through, `4cff754..c60a98e`, with no force. GitHub shows all three commits attributed to Samuel1505. Head of `main` is `c60a98e9cc2a97d587dd5ff32f88608df57fd3b9`, so https://github.com/Samuel1505/Unless/commit/c60a98e9cc2a97d587dd5ff32f88608df57fd3b9 is the latest commit.\n\n**4. Vercel, for you to do:** in the workbench header, open Integrations and choose **Deploy to Vercel**. Then set these in the Vercel project:\n- Framework: Vite\n- Build command: `bun run build`\n- Output directory: `dist`\n- Environment variable `VITE_NETWORK=mainnet`, for Production\n\n`vercel.json` is at the repo root, so its `Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'` and `X-Frame-Options: DENY` headers apply to all paths without extra settings.\n\nSend me the production URL and I'll run `curl -sI` on it and confirm both headers. I'll also smoke-test the page.",
